      "t": "p",
      "text": "The BC Ministry of Education and Child Care school list shows 69 schools with a Richmond street address: 53 public schools and 16 independent schools. It also shows 4 college and university campuses. In that list, 10 schools marked as offering French Immersion, 2 Francophone schools run by the Conseil scolaire francophone, 2 alternate programs and 3 online schools."
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Public schools here are run by School District 38 (Richmond) and School District 93 (Conseil scolaire francophone). Count by district: School District 38 (Richmond): 51, School District 93 (Conseil scolaire francophone): 2."
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "The list includes alternate programs, continuing education centres and online schools that have a street address, so the totals run higher than the number of neighbourhood schools; they sit under \"other public schools and programs\" below. The Ministry's own level field also mislabels some secondary schools as elementary, so this page reads the level from the school's name."
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "If you are buying with a child in mind, the address matters more than the list. A school's catchment decides which children it must take, and districts change catchments and set their own rules for French immersion and other programs. Ask the district about the exact address before you write an offer."
    },
